WEBVTT

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:33.450
Call robo-rooter when you flush a towel

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:36.787
And we can also help
With an impacted bowel

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.705
Robo-rooter

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:41.458
Mm. Mm.

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:44.211
Now this is what I call
1,000 years of progress.

00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:47.172
A Bavarian cream dog
that's also self-microwaving.

00:00:50.509 --> 00:00:53.428
Oh, geez, let's just pray
I have the energy

00:00:53.512 --> 00:00:55.681
to get myself another beer.

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:03.397
Oh, what is this? The middle ages?

00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:12.739
Look at you guys... No offense, Fry,

00:01:12.823 --> 00:01:14.616
but you've become a fat sack of crap.

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:15.701
Sack!

00:01:15.784 --> 00:01:17.744
And, Bender, your beer belly's so big

00:01:17.828 --> 00:01:19.830
your door won't even close...

00:01:20.205 --> 00:01:21.540
...and that doesn't even make sense.

00:01:21.623 --> 00:01:23.959
Come on, we're taking you pigs to the gym.

00:01:24.042 --> 00:01:26.837
The gymnasium? Excellent, excellent.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:30.674
For some reason,
I'm frisky as a squid on Tuesday.

00:01:53.864 --> 00:01:55.949
Hey, who's up for a nice hot steam?

00:01:56.158 --> 00:01:58.994
We crustaceans don't like steam.

00:01:59.077 --> 00:02:01.455
I'm going to go work
out with the Nautilus.

00:02:01.538 --> 00:02:02.664
What up, Dr. Z?

00:02:02.748 --> 00:02:04.958
Yo, yo, yo, whassup? Whassup?
Give up the rock!

00:02:08.295 --> 00:02:11.423
Coed steam rooms... I love the future!

00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:14.551
Uh, Fry, you're in the women's steam room.

00:02:14.676 --> 00:02:17.346
Ah... Futuristic.

00:02:17.429 --> 00:02:20.474
Psst. Look what life was like
before genetic engineering.

00:02:20.557 --> 00:02:22.601
Those poor 20th-century women.

00:02:25.354 --> 00:02:26.647
Hey, handsome...

00:02:26.730 --> 00:02:28.190
Is there room in there for two?

00:02:28.273 --> 00:02:30.442
You wish.

00:02:33.445 --> 00:02:36.698
Hey, Leela, look who's the superstud.

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:39.368
Hm. Somebody must have
turned down the gravity.

00:02:39.451 --> 00:02:40.661
I'll fix it for you.

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:46.416
Give me that.

00:02:51.255 --> 00:02:52.548
More weight.

00:02:56.927 --> 00:02:58.929
Dr. Zoidberg,
what's that jazz on your head?

00:02:59.012 --> 00:03:01.431
Enough with the questions, more weight!

00:03:02.641 --> 00:03:04.017
More!

00:03:05.853 --> 00:03:06.895
More!

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:12.276
Maybe you could do more reps
with less weight.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:19.908
Hey, looks like Zoidberg's
finally coming out of his shell.

00:03:20.242 --> 00:03:21.869
Get it?

00:03:21.952 --> 00:03:23.370
He's coming out of...

00:03:35.549 --> 00:03:39.219
Nice and gentle.
We don't want any unnecessary stress.

00:03:46.643 --> 00:03:48.520
Is there a doctor in the gym?

00:03:48.604 --> 00:03:50.564
I'm a doctor!

00:04:00.824 --> 00:04:03.285
I wonder why Dr. Zoidberg
is acting this way?

00:04:03.368 --> 00:04:05.746
Out of all of us,
he always seemed the most normal.

00:04:05.829 --> 00:04:06.830
I am normal.

00:04:06.914 --> 00:04:09.249
Amy, take off these rubber bands

00:04:09.333 --> 00:04:12.002
and I'll show you how normal I am.

00:04:12.085 --> 00:04:14.171
Fool me seven times, shame on you.

00:04:14.254 --> 00:04:16.757
Fool me eight or more times, shame on me.

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:18.425
Maybe he has a parasite.

00:04:18.509 --> 00:04:20.093
Maybe he is a parasite!

00:04:20.177 --> 00:04:22.804
It's always so sad
when a friend goes crazy

00:04:22.888 --> 00:04:25.432
and you have to have
a big clambake and cook him!

00:04:25.557 --> 00:04:26.683
Yee-haw!

00:04:26.767 --> 00:04:28.894
Now, now, this won't do.

00:04:28.977 --> 00:04:31.480
Let me just give old Zoidie a sedative.

00:04:32.397 --> 00:04:33.941
Oh, much better.

00:04:34.024 --> 00:04:36.193
You can take off these rubber bands now.

00:04:36.276 --> 00:04:38.111
- I'll do it.
- Stop! No!

00:04:38.195 --> 00:04:39.279
Moron!

00:04:39.363 --> 00:04:42.824
Mm-hm. Oh-oh. Aha!

00:04:42.991 --> 00:04:44.201
There's the problem.

00:04:44.284 --> 00:04:46.870
Give it to me straight, Professor.
Is it fin rot?

00:04:46.954 --> 00:04:48.247
It's fin rot, isn't it?

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:49.665
Tell me it's not fin rot!

00:04:49.748 --> 00:04:53.126
Relax my chitiny chum. There's no problem.

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:56.129
You're just heavy with male jelly.

00:04:56.213 --> 00:04:57.339
Blegh.

00:04:57.422 --> 00:05:00.384
It must be mating season
for Zoidberg's people.

00:05:00.467 --> 00:05:02.761
A chaotic time
when his behavior is dictated

00:05:02.845 --> 00:05:05.806
- by the tiny brain in his rump.
- Yuck.

00:05:06.181 --> 00:05:07.933
There's only one thing we can do...

00:05:08.058 --> 00:05:09.560
I'll get the water boiling.

00:05:09.685 --> 00:05:11.436
We, by which I mean you,

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:14.439
will have to rush him
to his ancient homeworld,

00:05:14.523 --> 00:05:15.899
which will shortly erupt

00:05:15.983 --> 00:05:18.485
in an orgy of invertebrate sex.

00:05:18.569 --> 00:05:20.112
Oh, baby, I'm there!

00:05:20.195 --> 00:05:23.198
Fry, do you even understand
the word invertebrate?

00:05:23.282 --> 00:05:25.325
Nope, but that's not the word
I'm interested in.

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:28.287
No need to pack pants, people! Let's roll!

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:31.164
Dr. Zoidberg said
I should hold these while he's gone.

00:05:35.043 --> 00:05:36.503
Moron!

00:05:55.647 --> 00:05:57.107
Welcome home, old friend.

00:05:57.191 --> 00:05:59.902
Just 19 hours until the mating frenzy.

00:06:04.031 --> 00:06:05.866
Excellent, excellent.

00:06:05.949 --> 00:06:07.117
See you there, Doctor...

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:10.078
Is that how you say Zoidberg?

00:06:13.123 --> 00:06:16.502
You didn't have to call attention
to his speech impediment.

00:06:16.585 --> 00:06:18.879
You're looking less nuts, crabby.

00:06:18.962 --> 00:06:21.131
I'm feeling less nuts, thank you.

00:06:21.215 --> 00:06:24.009
Because tomorrow,
I will be depositing my jelly

00:06:24.092 --> 00:06:26.261
in the cloacal vents of a female,

00:06:26.345 --> 00:06:28.013
if you catch my drift.

00:06:28.096 --> 00:06:29.389
Who's the lucky lobsterina?

00:06:29.473 --> 00:06:30.557
I don't know yet.

00:06:30.641 --> 00:06:32.809
But I shall attract one this afternoon

00:06:32.893 --> 00:06:34.353
with an erotic display.

00:06:34.436 --> 00:06:37.731
It's amazing that your people
can fall in love so fast.

00:06:37.814 --> 00:06:40.275
Love? That word is unknown here.

00:06:40.359 --> 00:06:43.237
I'm simply looking
for a female swollen with eggs

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:45.364
to accept my genetic material.

00:06:45.447 --> 00:06:46.949
You and me both, brother.

00:06:47.533 --> 00:06:51.119
Ah. My old scuttling grounds.
Let's pull over.

00:06:57.334 --> 00:07:00.254
I used to hang out here as a larva.

00:07:00.337 --> 00:07:03.131
It looked so much bigger back then.

00:07:05.592 --> 00:07:08.178
Who's the tough guy now, Vinnie?

00:07:16.061 --> 00:07:17.479
Look, outdoor theater.

00:07:17.563 --> 00:07:19.314
Let's get tickets. Oh, let's do.

00:07:19.398 --> 00:07:22.234
No, it's the ceremony of claw-plach,

00:07:22.317 --> 00:07:25.571
where my species
fight to the death over matters of honor.

00:07:25.654 --> 00:07:28.448
Also whether abbreviations
count in Scrabble.

00:07:28.574 --> 00:07:29.658
They don't.

00:07:29.741 --> 00:07:32.744
I didn't come here
to see any activity involving two guys.

00:07:32.828 --> 00:07:34.788
Where do you people do
your erotic display?

00:07:34.872 --> 00:07:36.498
Same place as your species...

00:07:36.582 --> 00:07:37.791
The beach.

00:07:43.005 --> 00:07:45.048
- How do I look?
- Like whale barf.

00:07:45.174 --> 00:07:46.717
Then the illusion is complete.

00:07:48.427 --> 00:07:51.388
Hey, I wonder if these guys are here
to watch the erotic display, too.

00:07:53.765 --> 00:07:56.268
Perfect. This ought to make me stand out.

00:08:03.901 --> 00:08:05.277
Look how ridiculous they look.

00:08:05.402 --> 00:08:08.697
Please, he's no different
from the rest of you organisms,

00:08:08.822 --> 00:08:11.909
shooting DNA at each other to make babies.

00:08:11.992 --> 00:08:13.452
I find it offensive.

00:08:13.952 --> 00:08:16.455
Keep your jelly away from my eggs.

00:08:17.372 --> 00:08:19.875
So not interested.

00:08:21.835 --> 00:08:23.545
I've heard that line before.

00:08:24.755 --> 00:08:26.340
Aw...

00:08:32.346 --> 00:08:34.097
What's the point?

00:08:36.642 --> 00:08:38.727
Why is Zoidberg the only one still alone?

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:40.896
'Cause he's a loser, that's why.

00:08:40.979 --> 00:08:43.190
He's the lobster equivalent of Fry.

00:08:43.273 --> 00:08:46.485
Hey, I can get any girl I want,
anytime I want.

00:08:46.568 --> 00:08:47.986
I'm just too busy.

00:08:55.619 --> 00:08:56.662
Edna.

00:08:56.745 --> 00:08:58.830
Edna, it's me, Zoidberg.

00:08:58.914 --> 00:09:00.791
Remember? From high school?

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:03.085
You used to laugh at me

00:09:03.168 --> 00:09:05.295
because my face was covered
with barnacles?

00:09:05.379 --> 00:09:06.713
Zoidberg?

00:09:06.797 --> 00:09:08.924
Well, I didn't know you were back in town.

00:09:09.007 --> 00:09:11.552
I heard you went off
and became a rich doctor.

00:09:11.635 --> 00:09:14.304
I've performed a few mercy killings.

00:09:14.388 --> 00:09:16.807
So, as long as I'm in town,

00:09:16.890 --> 00:09:18.433
I was wondering if maybe...

00:09:19.017 --> 00:09:21.436
- Craw?
- Oh, gee.

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:25.399
Yeah, I'm just going through
a lot of things right now and...

00:09:25.649 --> 00:09:26.692
Look, Zoidberg,

00:09:26.775 --> 00:09:29.069
I carry more eggs than any other female

00:09:29.152 --> 00:09:30.737
and I owe it to our race

00:09:30.821 --> 00:09:33.115
to pick a mate
who's stuffed with male jelly.

00:09:33.198 --> 00:09:34.533
Maybe a rock star.

00:09:34.616 --> 00:09:36.326
Or maybe a doctor.

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:38.078
I'm sorry, Zoidberg.

00:09:38.161 --> 00:09:40.539
You're just an inferior male specimen.

00:09:40.622 --> 00:09:42.583
Nice seeing you again.

00:09:49.089 --> 00:09:51.758
No one will ever want to mate with me.

00:09:51.842 --> 00:09:53.677
Not with a puny claw like this.

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:55.637
Did you see those other guys?

00:09:55.721 --> 00:09:58.307
They look like giant claws
with bodies attached.

00:09:58.390 --> 00:10:00.309
At least you didn't smell as bad as them.

00:10:00.392 --> 00:10:01.810
You're right!

00:10:01.894 --> 00:10:04.521
My stink gland is weak. Smell.

00:10:06.023 --> 00:10:07.733
Listen, Doc, if you want to score,

00:10:07.816 --> 00:10:09.568
you've got to fake like you're in love.

00:10:09.651 --> 00:10:12.321
Just look her in the eye,
start crying and say,

00:10:12.404 --> 00:10:15.240
"I've never been so happy."

00:10:15.324 --> 00:10:18.452
Oh, if a guy ever did that to me,
I'd know it.

00:10:19.077 --> 00:10:21.955
Wait a second.
They've all been doing that to me.

00:10:22.372 --> 00:10:24.458
Even Sean.

00:10:26.752 --> 00:10:31.340
Hm. This "love" intrigues me.
Teach me to fake it.

00:10:32.508 --> 00:10:35.177
Okay, you're on a date.
What's the first thing you do?

00:10:35.385 --> 00:10:36.637
Ask her to mate with me.

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:39.640
- No. Tell her she's special.
- But she's not.

00:10:39.723 --> 00:10:42.643
She's merely the female
with the largest clutch of eggs.

00:10:42.726 --> 00:10:44.478
Well, tell her that, and then...

00:10:44.561 --> 00:10:46.813
- Then mating.
- No, make up some feelings

00:10:46.897 --> 00:10:48.524
and tell her you have them.

00:10:49.274 --> 00:10:51.485
- Yes?
- Is desire to mate a feeling?

00:10:51.568 --> 00:10:54.363
Oh, you're not even trying.

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:57.991
It's all so complicated
with the flowers and the romance

00:10:58.075 --> 00:11:00.244
and the lies upon lies...

00:11:00.327 --> 00:11:01.495
Okay, okay, don't worry.

00:11:01.578 --> 00:11:04.873
The love-meister
will take you under his wing.

00:11:04.957 --> 00:11:07.501
What, now there's a bird involved?

00:11:09.795 --> 00:11:11.922
Okay, go ahead.

00:11:15.425 --> 00:11:17.553
What the... Dr. Zoidberg?

00:11:17.636 --> 00:11:19.680
Your mating display failed.

00:11:19.763 --> 00:11:21.515
Why are you trying to talk to me?

00:11:21.598 --> 00:11:22.891
I have no idea.

00:11:22.975 --> 00:11:25.394
You just want to talk.
It has nothing to do with mating.

00:11:25.477 --> 00:11:26.770
I just want to talk.

00:11:26.854 --> 00:11:28.564
It has nothing to do with mating.

00:11:28.647 --> 00:11:30.524
Fry, that doesn't make sense.

00:11:30.607 --> 00:11:33.944
Dr. Zoidberg, that doesn't make sense...
But okay.

00:11:34.027 --> 00:11:35.153
Start with a compliment.

00:11:35.237 --> 00:11:36.363
Tell her she looks thin.

00:11:36.446 --> 00:11:37.906
You seem malnourished.

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:40.534
Are you suffering from internal parasites?

00:11:40.617 --> 00:11:42.870
Why, yes. Thanks for noticing.

00:11:42.953 --> 00:11:44.746
Now ask her how her day was.

00:11:44.830 --> 00:11:46.206
Why would I want to know?

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:47.708
You wouldn't. Ask anyway.

00:11:47.791 --> 00:11:49.376
How was your day?

00:11:49.459 --> 00:11:52.629
Well, first, I got up
and had a piece of toast,

00:11:52.713 --> 00:11:54.339
then I brushed my teeth,

00:11:54.423 --> 00:11:56.758
then I went to the store
to buy some fish, then I...

00:11:56.842 --> 00:11:58.010
Fry, look what you did.

00:11:58.093 --> 00:11:59.094
She won't shut up.

00:11:59.178 --> 00:12:02.389
That's normal.
Just nod your head and say, "Uh-huh."

00:12:02.514 --> 00:12:03.724
Uh-huh. Uh-huh.

00:12:03.807 --> 00:12:06.226
And then you threw
an octopus at my window.

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:10.022
You know, Zoidberg, it's crazy,
but when you talk this way

00:12:10.105 --> 00:12:13.442
your obvious deficiencies
as a male seem...

00:12:13.525 --> 00:12:14.735
Less obvious.

00:12:14.818 --> 00:12:16.987
Your genes seem less detrimental.

00:12:18.405 --> 00:12:19.907
You even stink more.

00:12:19.990 --> 00:12:21.325
Do I ask her to mate now?

00:12:21.408 --> 00:12:22.409
Third date.

00:12:24.453 --> 00:12:26.163
So I returned his artificial heart

00:12:26.246 --> 00:12:27.539
and ever since then

00:12:27.623 --> 00:12:30.000
I've been known by the name
of Honest Bender.

00:12:32.961 --> 00:12:37.674
I'd like to propose a toast to...
Coat check number 84.

00:12:37.758 --> 00:12:40.719
- Turn it over.
- Oh. Edna...

00:12:40.802 --> 00:12:44.681
Of all the slimy, gross crab monsters
on this planet,

00:12:44.765 --> 00:12:47.184
you are apparently the hottest.

00:12:47.392 --> 00:12:48.435
Oy.

00:12:48.519 --> 00:12:50.771
That's the most beautiful thing
I've ever heard.

00:12:50.854 --> 00:12:55.025
Yes, well, excuse me.
I've got to powder my mouth flaps.

00:12:55.150 --> 00:12:57.986
Uh, me, too.

00:12:58.070 --> 00:12:59.780
I'm confused, Fry.

00:12:59.863 --> 00:13:02.324
I'm feeling a strange new emotion.

00:13:02.407 --> 00:13:06.245
Is it love when you care about a female
for reasons beyond mating?

00:13:06.328 --> 00:13:08.997
Nope. Must be some weird alien emotion.

00:13:11.250 --> 00:13:14.711
Zoidberg said some dumb stuff,
but he's a nice guy, really.

00:13:14.795 --> 00:13:17.464
It's just that Fry's been
telling him what to say

00:13:17.548 --> 00:13:20.843
and Fry's a...
Do you have idiots on your planet?

00:13:20.926 --> 00:13:22.135
Fry?

00:13:22.219 --> 00:13:24.471
You mean, words of such beauty

00:13:24.555 --> 00:13:27.432
came from the blowhole
of that hideous alien?

00:13:27.516 --> 00:13:28.767
Yeah. What?

00:13:29.142 --> 00:13:31.061
Look, never mind the words.

00:13:31.144 --> 00:13:32.771
Zoidberg's a doctor.

00:13:32.896 --> 00:13:34.731
A doctor, honey.

00:13:45.993 --> 00:13:49.037
Come in.

00:13:55.878 --> 00:13:57.254
Hello, Fry.

00:13:57.337 --> 00:14:01.842
Can I interest you in some surf and turf?

00:14:01.925 --> 00:14:02.926
No, thanks.

00:14:03.051 --> 00:14:05.345
I just came to tell you
that Zoidberg's really great.

00:14:05.429 --> 00:14:07.514
He's got male jelly coming out the wazoo.

00:14:07.598 --> 00:14:11.101
Well, that is where it comes out,
but jelly isn't everything.

00:14:11.185 --> 00:14:14.313
I know Zoidberg's magical words
were really yours.

00:14:14.396 --> 00:14:18.734
Teach me to love you,
squishy poet from beyond the stars.

00:14:20.277 --> 00:14:22.362
Uh, I'm flattered, really.

00:14:22.446 --> 00:14:24.573
If I was going to do it with a big,
freaky mud bug,

00:14:24.656 --> 00:14:25.991
you'd be way up the list.

00:14:26.074 --> 00:14:27.951
Hush, you romantic fool.

00:14:28.035 --> 00:14:30.537
Engage your mandibles and kiss me.

00:14:38.128 --> 00:14:39.379
Edna?

00:14:39.463 --> 00:14:41.673
I couldn't stand it any longer. I...

00:14:45.802 --> 00:14:47.304
Fry!

00:14:48.931 --> 00:14:51.225
Dr. Zoidberg, it's not how it looks.

00:14:51.308 --> 00:14:53.894
Her caviar is on your neck!

00:14:53.977 --> 00:14:55.646
- But...
- Oh, it's true, Zoidberg.

00:14:55.729 --> 00:14:57.814
We can't hide it any longer.

00:14:57.940 --> 00:15:00.567
Fry and I have fallen in love
and we're going to mate tomorrow.

00:15:00.651 --> 00:15:01.818
What?

00:15:01.902 --> 00:15:05.572
Fry, I challenge you to claw-plach.

00:15:07.366 --> 00:15:08.367
English, please?

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:10.536
A fight to the death.

00:15:12.204 --> 00:15:16.166
And if you survive, we'll make sweet love.

00:15:24.633 --> 00:15:26.844
The law is clear.

00:15:26.927 --> 00:15:29.972
Fry and Zoidberg shall fight to the death

00:15:30.055 --> 00:15:32.766
for the claw of the beautiful Edna!

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:33.892
But I don't want her!

00:15:33.976 --> 00:15:37.437
Once invoked,
the sacred tradition of claw-plach

00:15:37.521 --> 00:15:39.064
cannot be taken back.

00:15:39.147 --> 00:15:42.192
It is a recent tradition,
only 18 years old,

00:15:42.276 --> 00:15:44.403
but it is a tradition nonetheless!

00:15:55.706 --> 00:15:57.207
Get ready, Fry.

00:15:57.291 --> 00:16:00.794
I'm going to rip your swim bladder out
and show it to you.

00:16:00.878 --> 00:16:02.921
Dr. Zoidberg, this is madness!

00:16:03.005 --> 00:16:04.506
You're being irrational!

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:05.966
Of course I'm being irrational!

00:16:06.049 --> 00:16:07.718
- I'm in love!
- Aw.

00:16:08.051 --> 00:16:09.720
- Leela!
- Right, right.

00:16:09.803 --> 00:16:12.181
You have to stop this madness!

00:16:12.264 --> 00:16:15.517
Listen, lady, as you can plainly see,

00:16:15.601 --> 00:16:19.021
I'm a highly desirable male,
groaning with jelly,

00:16:19.104 --> 00:16:21.190
yet I embrace a life of celibacy

00:16:21.273 --> 00:16:23.650
in order to uphold our crazy traditions.

00:16:23.734 --> 00:16:25.986
One of your friends must die!

00:16:26.069 --> 00:16:30.407
Fate is cruel and unyielding,
and what must be, must be.

00:16:31.283 --> 00:16:32.326
Taking all bets!

00:16:32.409 --> 00:16:34.578
I'm giving nine to two on Zoidberg,

00:16:34.661 --> 00:16:37.122
the crab with the jab, the great red hope.

00:16:37.206 --> 00:16:38.999
Come on, baby!

00:16:39.082 --> 00:16:41.585
Fry, it's been years since medical school,

00:16:41.668 --> 00:16:44.379
disemboweling in your species...

00:16:44.463 --> 00:16:46.507
- Fatal or non-fatal?
- Fatal.

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:49.176
Large bet on myself in round one!

00:16:49.259 --> 00:16:54.139
Edna, have you anything to say
before begins the claw-plach?

00:16:54.223 --> 00:16:55.390
I do.

00:16:55.474 --> 00:16:57.518
I just want to say that today I got up

00:16:57.601 --> 00:16:59.019
and I had a piece of toast.

00:16:59.102 --> 00:17:00.646
Then I brushed my teeth...

00:17:00.729 --> 00:17:01.897
Shut up!

00:17:01.980 --> 00:17:03.649
I love you, Fry!

00:17:03.732 --> 00:17:06.485
No!

00:17:06.568 --> 00:17:10.072
Fry, having guessed what animal
I was thinking of,

00:17:10.155 --> 00:17:12.950
you shall have first choice of weapon.

00:17:15.702 --> 00:17:18.914
Uh-huh. Mm... Ah.

00:17:21.416 --> 00:17:22.543
And you, Doctor?

00:17:22.626 --> 00:17:24.461
I choose my own claws.

00:17:24.545 --> 00:17:28.590
I want the tactile pleasure of chopping
him right here, in the gonads.

00:17:28.674 --> 00:17:30.342
Shh. Nobody correct him!

00:17:31.552 --> 00:17:34.429
Fry, I've never asked you
for anything before,

00:17:34.513 --> 00:17:35.973
but if it's not too much trouble,

00:17:36.056 --> 00:17:37.850
when it comes to the ninth round,

00:17:37.933 --> 00:17:39.017
just let him win.

00:17:39.101 --> 00:17:40.561
But it's a fight to the death!

00:17:40.644 --> 00:17:43.313
Oh, so suddenly this is all about you!

00:17:43.438 --> 00:17:44.648
Sheesh.

00:17:44.731 --> 00:17:47.150
Please rise for the national anthem.

00:17:51.029 --> 00:17:52.030
Uh-oh.

00:17:53.657 --> 00:17:57.119
Let claw-plach begin!

00:18:10.299 --> 00:18:11.717
Aha.

00:18:13.260 --> 00:18:14.428
Oh!

00:18:16.513 --> 00:18:18.098
Hey.

00:18:21.768 --> 00:18:22.853
Ow.

00:18:36.867 --> 00:18:37.910
Come on, Fry!

00:18:37.993 --> 00:18:39.453
Die with dignity!

00:18:40.871 --> 00:18:42.122
Aha.

00:18:42.581 --> 00:18:43.582
Oops.

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:52.382
No! I can't stand to look!

00:18:52.508 --> 00:18:54.343
Huh? Huh...

00:18:57.804 --> 00:18:59.723
- Crack him open!
- Kill him!

00:18:59.806 --> 00:19:02.017
Psst. Fry, take a dive!

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:07.439
Claw-plach, claw-plach, claw-plach!

00:19:14.738 --> 00:19:16.365
My fellow fish monsters,

00:19:16.448 --> 00:19:19.326
far be it from me to question
your stupid civilization

00:19:19.409 --> 00:19:20.452
or its dumb customs

00:19:20.536 --> 00:19:22.621
but is squeezing each other's brains out

00:19:22.704 --> 00:19:25.499
with a giant nutcracker
really going to solve anything?

00:19:25.582 --> 00:19:28.001
Dr. Zoidberg is my friend

00:19:28.085 --> 00:19:29.878
and though a woman has come between us,

00:19:29.962 --> 00:19:32.047
I say we'll always remain friends.

00:19:32.172 --> 00:19:33.757
And do you know why?

00:19:33.882 --> 00:19:35.592
One reason.

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:40.681
You bastard!

00:19:40.764 --> 00:19:41.765
I'll kill you!

00:19:41.849 --> 00:19:43.767
You bastard!

00:19:51.567 --> 00:19:55.362
Wait, stop! Everyone is gone!

00:19:55.445 --> 00:19:57.614
Edna? Honey?

00:20:04.079 --> 00:20:05.372
Edna!

00:20:15.132 --> 00:20:16.300
My God!

00:20:16.383 --> 00:20:19.261
The frenzy! Aw...

00:20:19.386 --> 00:20:23.182
The greatest experience in life
and I missed it.

00:20:24.850 --> 00:20:27.186
Aw, I'm sorry, Doc.

00:20:30.022 --> 00:20:32.232
Ow, ow! Ah.

00:20:33.859 --> 00:20:35.694
The frenzy is over.

00:20:35.777 --> 00:20:38.780
How will I ever get rid
of my male jelly now?

00:20:38.864 --> 00:20:40.616
- I'll lend you this.
- Fry!

00:20:40.866 --> 00:20:42.075
Hey, hey!

00:20:42.451 --> 00:20:43.785
Shoo, get away!

00:20:43.869 --> 00:20:47.247
Hey! What's with the flying jerks?

00:20:47.331 --> 00:20:49.416
They come to feast after the frenzy.

00:20:49.541 --> 00:20:53.420
Once my species passes on its genes,
it dies.

00:20:55.380 --> 00:20:56.548
You mean you have to choose

00:20:56.632 --> 00:20:58.884
between a life without sex
and a gruesome death?

00:20:58.967 --> 00:21:00.928
- Yes.
- Tough call.

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:05.098
Well, it was nice of you

00:21:05.182 --> 00:21:07.226
to let me reattach your arm, Fry.

00:21:07.309 --> 00:21:10.896
Especially after I made
a complete eel out of myself.

00:21:10.979 --> 00:21:12.523
- No biggie.
- Yes, biggie.

00:21:12.648 --> 00:21:15.526
I learned to feel things
I've never felt before...

00:21:15.651 --> 00:21:19.446
Love, jealousy, passion for disemboweling.

00:21:19.571 --> 00:21:21.406
I owe it all to you.

00:21:22.241 --> 00:21:25.494
There. I pronounce the operation
a success.

00:21:25.577 --> 00:21:26.954
- Hooray!
- Yeah!

00:21:28.163 --> 00:21:29.748
I may not know from emotions

00:21:29.831 --> 00:21:32.960
but when it comes to medicine?
Forget about it.

00:21:33.335 --> 00:21:35.003
I don't mean to nitpick, super-doc,

00:21:35.087 --> 00:21:38.423
but do you think maybe
you could take one more whack at this?

00:21:38.507 --> 00:21:41.426
For you, my friend? Anything.

00:21:43.387 --> 00:21:44.471
My legs!

00:21:44.555 --> 00:21:47.724
All right, all right.
Third time's the charm.